      "EVORAO:antibodySpecificity": "This antibody is specific for the S1 domain of spike protein of SARS-CoV-2 virus.",
      "EVORAO:antibodyCharacterizationObservation": "The antibody showed reactivity towards ancestral SARS-CoV-2 S-trimer (Sino Biological; 40589-V08H8) positive and S1 (Sino Biological; 40591-V08H3) positive, but not to RBD (Sino Biological; 40592-V08H) as determined using ELISA. Antibody showed high affinity for S1 as determined by ELISA.  Binding to ancestral SARS-CoV-2 antigens was verified on protein micro-array (Aguilar-Bretones et al., JCI 2021).  Binding to SARS-CoV-2 Omicron BA.5 variant was detected but not to Delta and Omicron BA.1. No cross-reactivity towards hCoV-OC43, hCoV-NL63, hCoV-HKU1, hCoV-229E was detected. Antibody purity was assessed on SDS-PAGE and showed >95% purity.",
