      "EVORAO:antibodyCharacterizationObservation": "The antibody showed reactivity towards ancestral SARS-CoV-2 S-trimer (Sino Biological; 40589-V08H8) and S2 domain (Sino Biological; 40590-V08H1). Antibody showed high affinity for S2 as determined by ELISA. Binding to ancestral SARS-CoV-2 antigens was verified on protein micro array. Binding to the Omicron BA.1 and BA.5 variants was detected but not to Delta. No cross-reactivity to hCoV-OC43, hCoV-NL63, hCoV-HKU1, hCoV-229E was detected.",
      "EVORAO:antibodyPurifiedByAffinity": true,
      "EVORAO:biosafetyRestrictions": "none",
      "EVORAO:iataClassification": "NON DANGEROUS GOODS",
      "EVORAO:previouslyKnownAs": "2019-nCoV",
