      "search:title": "SARS-CoV-2 strain Slovakia/SK-BMC-BA42/2022- Omicron VOC BA.5.2",
      "search:description": "This SARS-CoV-2 strain was isolated from a COVID-19 patient from Slovakia in July 2022. The virus belongs to the BA.5.2 lineage (Omicron VOC). The virus is  preserved under Viral Storage Medium -80C. Tests for the presence of mycoplasmae were negative. To confirm its identity the virus has been fully sequenced.",
