      "dcterms:title": "Human immunodeficiency virus 2 - RH2.21-2B2",
      "dcterms:description": "This clone belongs to a unique set of HIV-2 biological clones from West African immigrants in The Netherlands. Clones were obtained from patients with non-progressive, aviremic or progressive, viremic HIV-2 infection. The HIV-2 biological clones were isolated after limiting dilution co-culture of patient PBMC or plasma with CD8-depleted PBMC from healthy blood bank donors. \r\nThe clone is replication competent and has been characterized for in vitro replication kinetics and co-receptor usage. Sequence is available in Genbank.",
      "EVORAO:unitDefinition": "Vial with 1 ml infectious culture supernatant.",
